# Dedicated build context; overrides the root build/ exclusion.
**
!build/
!build/upstream/
!build/upstream/hermes/
!build/upstream/hermes/**
build/upstream/hermes/**/.git
build/upstream/hermes/**/.git/**
build/upstream/hermes/**/.env
build/upstream/hermes/**/.env.*
!build/upstream/hermes/**/.env.example
build/upstream/hermes/**/.ssh/**
build/upstream/hermes/secrets/**
build/upstream/hermes/**/node_modules/**
build/upstream/hermes/**/.venv/**
build/upstream/hermes/**/__pycache__/**
!tools/
!tools/loop/
!tools/loop/bridge.py
!tools/loop/chat_tool.py
!tools/loop/director_tool.py
